# Development licence key slot, current (packages/entitlement/src/keys.ts).
# Empty until the operator creates the development signing key in the setup
# broker under D5 (dev-work-plan people dependency 4). P1-C then commits the
# development public key here as one SPKI PEM block, with the SHA-256
# fingerprint of its DER encoding in a comment (it-input-1 1.4).
# This key verifies internal-dev licences only, never customer licences.
